            "detailed_description": "<strong>Rotoscape</strong> is a fast-paced action puzzle game about rotating shapes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rotate to survive</h2>Rotoscape explores one simple mechanical idea - staying alive by rotating your surroundings. The game requires quick thinking as it tests your spatial awareness and reflexes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/fdce698c36b629dbc72f1c54eee1614d.poster.avif?t=1740696393\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/fdce698c36b629dbc72f1c54eee1614d.webm?t=1740696393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/fdce698c36b629dbc72f1c54eee1614d.mp4?t=1740696393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Many dimensions</h2>Starting with the simple triangle and working up in complexity to the most perfect shape of them all.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/3c994f3e128d912155b8fa32505f2803.poster.avif?t=1740696393\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/3c994f3e128d912155b8fa32505f2803.webm?t=1740696393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/3c994f3e128d912155b8fa32505f2803.mp4?t=1740696393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new characters</h2>Why force yourself to be a cube when you don't feel like it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/5c362e0cf98dd5d2f848caa815c9ded2.poster.avif?t=1740696393\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/5c362e0cf98dd5d2f848caa815c9ded2.webm?t=1740696393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/5c362e0cf98dd5d2f848caa815c9ded2.mp4?t=1740696393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defeat bosses</h2>Every dimension has something keeping you from the next dimension... will you be able to stop them?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/f668f6b612edf344f017c1aecf52ba84.poster.avif?t=1740696393\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/f668f6b612edf344f017c1aecf52ba84.webm?t=1740696393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663940/extras/f668f6b612edf344f017c1aecf52ba84.mp4?t=1740696393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboards</h2>Compete with friends and other players for the top scores!",
